---
description: Use local Go + Wails + Node for this desktop template; avoid Docker for the default workflow.
globs: "*.go, go.mod, go.sum, wails.json, frontend/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

Default to local toolchains. Do not introduce Docker for the default Wails workflow.

- Pin the Go version with `go` and `toolchain` in `go.mod`
- Use Wails CLI for `dev` / `build`; regenerate bindings with `wails generate module`
- Frontend lives under `frontend/` (npm / Nuxt). Keep `wailsjs/` committed after binding changes
- Prefer the standard library before adding third-party Go modules
- Keep module path updates via `go mod edit -module ...`
